              "calc": "'drew nothing' if take == '' else ('drew from the deck' if take == 'DECK' else 'took ' + take + ' from the discards')"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "last_discard",
            "value": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck_size",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(deck)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat 2 {last_action} and {drew}. Deck: {deck_size} cards left. Discards: {discard_tops}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "end of round",
      "label": "score the round",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(0 if you.cnt_r == 0 else (you.sum_r - expedition_cost) * (wager_multiplier_base + you.wag_r) + (bonus_points if you.cnt_r >= bonus_card_count else 0)) + (0 if you.cnt_b == 0 else (you.sum_b - expedition_cost) * (wager_multiplier_base + you.wag_b) + (bonus_points if you.cnt_b >= bonus_card_count else 0)) + (0 if you.cnt_g == 0 else (you.sum_g - expedition_cost) * (wager_multiplier_base + you.wag_g) + (bonus_points if you.cnt_g >= bonus_card_count else 0))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Round {round} is over. Scores: Seat 1 {players[0].score}, Seat 2 {players[1].score}. Deck: {deck_size} cards left."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "end of round",
      "label": "is it over",
      "when": {
        "calc": "deck_size == 0 or round >= max_rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "deck_size == 0 or round >= max_rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.score",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final scores: Seat 1 {players[0].score}, Seat 2 {players[1].score}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 20,
    "rounds_max": 20,
    "actions_max": 1000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "CARDS. There are {total_cards} cards in {colours} colours: Red (R), Blue (B) and Green (G). Each colour has number cards {lowest_number} to {highest_number}, written like R7 or B10, plus {wagers_per_colour} wager cards, written RW, BW and GW.\n\nSETUP. All {total_cards} cards are shuffled into a face-down deck; this is the only random event in the game. Seat 1 is chosen at random. Each player is dealt {hand_size} cards, leaving {deck_after_deal} in the deck. Your hand is hidden from your opponent. The face-up discard row (discard_tops) starts empty and holds at most {max_discard_tops_per_colour} card per colour.\n\nROUND. Each round, seat 1 takes a full turn and then seat 2 takes a full turn.\n\nA TURN has two choices.\n(1) PLAY OR DISCARD. Answer 'PLAY X' or 'DISCARD X' for a card X in your hand. A PLAY is legal if X is a number greater than the highest number already played in its colour (top), or X is a wager and no number has been played in its colour yet. On a legal play, X leaves your hand and the colour's card count rises by 1; a number adds X to that colour's sum and becomes its top; a wager adds 1 to that colour's wagers. You are only offered legal plays; an illegal PLAY, or a card not in your hand, is treated as DISCARD of the first card in your hand. A DISCARD removes X from your hand; if the discard row already holds a card of X's colour, that old card is removed from the game permanently; then X is placed face up on the row and cannot be drawn back this turn.\n(2) DRAW. Answer 'DECK' to take the top card of the deck into your hand, or name a card on the discard row other than the one you just discarded to take it into your hand. An invalid answer, or naming the card you just discarded, means DECK. If the deck is empty you must take an eligible card from the discard row; if there is none, you draw nothing. After the draw, the just-discarded card may be drawn again by anyone.\n\nBoth players always see the discard row ({discard_tops}), both players' expedition numbers, and how many cards remain in the deck ({deck_size}).\n\nEND OF ROUND. Both scores are recomputed. For each colour: if it has no cards, it scores 0; otherwise it scores (sum - {expedition_cost}) x ({wager_multiplier_base} + wagers), plus {bonus_points} if it has {bonus_card_count} or more cards (wagers included). Your score is the total of your three colours.\n\nThe game ends at the end of the round in which the deck became empty, or at the end of round {max_rounds}, whichever comes first. Seat 2 always finishes the round, so both players take the same number of turns. The higher score wins; equal scores are a draw."
}
